OL,6,     FThe series that looks at books,
OL,7,     Fplays and stories and how they
OL,8,     Fwork. John Yorke explores the
OL,9,     Fenduring appeal and satirical bite
OL,10,     Fof Jonathan Swift's 1726 novel.
OL,11,G1500 Gulliver's Travels
OL,12,     F1/2. A new adaptation celebrating
OL,13,     Fthe 300th anniversary of Jonathan
OL,14,     FSwift's satire. Shipwrecked in
OL,15,     FLilliput, Gulliver is first a
OL,16,     Fgiant among tiny people, then a
OL,17,     Fcuriosity among giants.
